    "Turn ambiguous requirements into explicit, testable technical specifications.",
    "Debug unfamiliar failures methodically using evidence.",
    "Write tests that target invariants, boundaries and failure modes.",
    "Review code for correctness, maintainability, safety and performance.",
    "Explain engineering decisions in concise technical documents and postmortems."
